    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>AlMajdiah 168 is a residential development located in Riyadh, spanning a total land area of 65,780 square meters. The project consists of 468 residential units, all of which are apartments of various sizes.</p>\r\n",
    "projectDescriptionAr": "<div>\r\n<div aria-expanded=\"true\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div aria-label=\"Email message\" id=\"focused\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div role=\"document\">\r\n<div aria-label=\"Message body\" data-fui-focus-visible=\"\" id=\"UniqueMessageBody_11\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div visibility=\"hidden\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\">\r\n<div data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">إنشاء وحدات سكنية تقع بمدينة الرياض، على أرض بمساحة إجمالية تبلغ 65,780 متر مربع ويتكون من 468 وحدة سكنية بمساحات مختلفة&nbsp;من نوع شقق.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n",
